@startuml View User Details by Admin
actor Admin
participant ": UserManagementPage " as UserManagementPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": AuthController " as AuthController
participant ": UserService " as UserService
participant ": UserRepository " as UserRepository
database Database

Admin->UserManagementPage: 1. Click on a user to view details
    activate Admin
    activate UserManagementPage

UserManagementPage->UserManagementPage: 2. Open User Detail Modal

UserManagementPage->Router: 3. Send GET /api/users/{id}
    deactivate UserManagementPage
    activate Router

Router->AuthController: 4. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate AuthController

AuthController->UserService: 5. GetUserByIdAsync(id)
    deactivate AuthController
    activate UserService

UserService->UserRepository: 6. GetByIdAsync(id)
    activate UserRepository

UserRepository->Database: 7. Query User by Id with StudentProfile and TeacherProfile
    activate Database

Database-->UserRepository: 8. Return User with relations
    deactivate Database

UserRepository-->UserService: 9. Return User entity
    deactivate UserRepository

UserService->UserService: 10. Map User to UserDto

UserService-->AuthController: 11. Return UserDto
    activate AuthController
    deactivate UserService

AuthController-->Router: 12. Send User Details Response
    activate Router
    deactivate AuthController

Router-->UserManagementPage: 13. Display User Details
    activate UserManagementPage
    deactivate Router

UserManagementPage->UserManagementPage: 14. Render User Information

UserManagementPage-->Admin: 15. Show Complete User Details
    deactivate UserManagementPage
    deactivate Admin
@enduml




